# SmallFastDrone boards include this from their defaults.parm. It holds the
# values that keep a board behaving as it did when a PR in the SFD stack turns
# existing behaviour into an option or changes its default, and the EKF3
# options the SFD stack is flown with.

# #32473 made the acro accel-bias learning inhibit opt-in (ACC_ZBIAS_LEARN bit
# 3); the branch applied it unconditionally before that
ACC_ZBIAS_LEARN 8

# EK3_OPTIONS 92: optical flow may use terrain data above the range finder
# (bit 2), the AGL KF scales flow (bit 3) and feeds velD (bit 4), and the
# per-reset flow lockout messages are quiet in favour of the OSD (bit 6).
# Manual lane switching (bit 1) is left to each vehicle; bit 5 is unused
EK3_OPTIONS 92
